#
# Failing control for math:TensorShapeCountConstraint: a shape declares rank 3 and two
# axis nodes. The indices 0 and 1 are distinct, zero or greater and below 3, and a
# positive rank has an axis, so every other tensor-shape law holds; the disagreement
# between the rank and the number of axes is the only defect.
# Bound by ex:ecTensorRankAxisCountMismatch.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/tensor-shape-controls/> .

ex:shape a math:TensorShape ; math:tensorRank 3 ;
    math:shapeAxis ex:first, ex:second .
ex:first a math:TensorAxis ; math:axisIndex 0 .
ex:second a math:TensorAxis ; math:axisIndex 1 .
